{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear friends of Animia~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Animia</strong>, the biggest animal city in the world! Become a resident of this vibrant town and embark on a cozy adventure with your animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/db31e093ebe42f12687524ac8e7c92a5.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/db31e093ebe42f12687524ac8e7c92a5.webp?t=1761708823 width=1600 height=986 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was just a hardworking elite in the modern world... and somehow, I\u2019ve been transported into this animal kingdom\u2014only to become a rabbit!? This must be one of Ela\u2019s pranks! I have to find a way to return to my world\u2014but first, I need to survive in this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rabbit in Animia, you\u2019ll experience a heartwarming life full of possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with adorable animals, run a cozy restaurant, go on wild adventures, build your dream home, grow your own crops, and uncover the secrets hidden within this magical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a deep breath and dive into the peaceful life of Animia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/026997013ddace9b98873af761395954.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/026997013ddace9b98873af761395954.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every animal in the city is waiting to meet you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mochi the food-loving elephant, Timid the shy and earnest hamster, and Ka, the bar owner with a big heart. Chat, hang out, and share little slice-of-life stories with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll become best buddies, maybe even partners-in-crime in this daily life full of fun and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/0376f69bd50f7d362c351591a7d756c5.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/0376f69bd50f7d362c351591a7d756c5.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/0376f69bd50f7d362c351591a7d756c5.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/61b3bff4878370526ce873f09764be24.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/61b3bff4878370526ce873f09764be24.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to know your special someone</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo, your restaurant partner, offers you warmth when you feel lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiki, the proud and nature-loving fox, is cute but always teases you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ash, who never seems to like you... might just be hiding a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has their own story. With a little courage and curiosity, maybe you\u2019ll discover something more and find that one special companion who stays by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/06b04ad8e3a403bb7643d42abc51b3a8.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/06b04ad8e3a403bb7643d42abc51b3a8.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/06b04ad8e3a403bb7643d42abc51b3a8.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/c035655ea3afcbb1e1a239af65a15731.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/c035655ea3afcbb1e1a239af65a15731.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy fast-paced and satisfying combat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in action-packed roguelike battles with multiple weapon types and magical abilities. Mix and match skills to create your own ultimate fighting combo! Discover cute wild creatures along the way\u2014you might even take some of them home with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/c25bad99a1dc6e8c1331c722b7b59e27.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/c25bad99a1dc6e8c1331c722b7b59e27.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/c25bad99a1dc6e8c1331c722b7b59e27.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/05e8399d0ffcd7ac309d779b496a5bff.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/05e8399d0ffcd7ac309d779b496a5bff.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with MOMO to run your restaurant!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and expand your dream business. Meet quirky customers, upgrade your furniture, and turn your cozy shop into the top spot in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/01dc60d75341105465feb582b556263f.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/01dc60d75341105465feb582b556263f.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/01dc60d75341105465feb582b556263f.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/6e97321413c996306cb96ad26bef9db2.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/6e97321413c996306cb96ad26bef9db2.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your home from the ground up:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from an empty patch of land and turn it into your own dream homestead. Plant crops, decorate your space, upgrade your house, and make it truly yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/e12a3be712cabec60ac10676d1234d8b.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/e12a3be712cabec60ac10676d1234d8b.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/e12a3be712cabec60ac10676d1234d8b.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear friend, I\u2019ll be waiting for you in Animia. Let\u2019s live this wonderful animal life together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927950?t=1761708823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/c21c08758b54dbdd8d7e3d1f2abb27b064dc6eb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761708823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/c2abf7abd5ea1818d5e6843a0a7ac30cbd1e46f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761708823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/c2abf7abd5ea1818d5e6843a0a7ac30cbd1e46f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761708823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Make friends with animals</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/a79a4c70687523c7a86c651dcb894fd3.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1000 height=2360 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear friends of Animia~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Animia</strong>, the biggest animal city in the world! Become a resident of this vibrant town and embark on a cozy adventure with your animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/db31e093ebe42f12687524ac8e7c92a5.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/db31e093ebe42f12687524ac8e7c92a5.webp?t=1761708823 width=1600 height=986 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was just a hardworking elite in the modern world... and somehow, I\u2019ve been transported into this animal kingdom\u2014only to become a rabbit!? This must be one of Ela\u2019s pranks! I have to find a way to return to my world\u2014but first, I need to survive in this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a rabbit in Animia, you\u2019ll experience a heartwarming life full of possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with adorable animals, run a cozy restaurant, go on wild adventures, build your dream home, grow your own crops, and uncover the secrets hidden within this magical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a deep breath and dive into the peaceful life of Animia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/026997013ddace9b98873af761395954.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/026997013ddace9b98873af761395954.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every animal in the city is waiting to meet you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mochi the food-loving elephant, Timid the shy and earnest hamster, and Ka, the bar owner with a big heart. Chat, hang out, and share little slice-of-life stories with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll become best buddies, maybe even partners-in-crime in this daily life full of fun and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/0376f69bd50f7d362c351591a7d756c5.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/0376f69bd50f7d362c351591a7d756c5.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/0376f69bd50f7d362c351591a7d756c5.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/61b3bff4878370526ce873f09764be24.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/61b3bff4878370526ce873f09764be24.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to know your special someone</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momo, your restaurant partner, offers you warmth when you feel lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiki, the proud and nature-loving fox, is cute but always teases you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ash, who never seems to like you... might just be hiding a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has their own story. With a little courage and curiosity, maybe you\u2019ll discover something more and find that one special companion who stays by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/06b04ad8e3a403bb7643d42abc51b3a8.poster.avif?t=1761708823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/06b04ad8e3a403bb7643d42abc51b3a8.webm?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/06b04ad8e3a403bb7643d42abc51b3a8.mp4?t=1761708823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras/c035655ea3afcbb1e1a239af65a15731.avif?t=1761708823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927950/extras_big/c035655ea3afcbb1e1a239af65a15731.avif?t=1761708823 width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy fast-paced and satisfying combat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in action-packed roguelike battles with multiple weapon types and magical abilities. Mix and match skills to create your own ultimate fighting combo! Discover cute wild creatures along the way\u2014you might even take some of them home with you!</p><p class=\"bb_parag